---
title: "PDF Export - Page Setup"
enterprise: true
---

Use `PdfExportParams` to configure the PDF page and table layout.

```{% frameworkTransform=true %}
api.exportDataAsPdf({
    pageSize: 'A4',
    pageOrientation: 'landscape',
    margin: { top: 36, right: 24, bottom: 36, left: 24 },
    fontSize: 9,
    headerFontSize: 10,
    cellPadding: 4,
    repeatHeader: true,
    drawCellBorders: true,
});
```

Custom page sizes use points:

```{% frameworkTransform=true %}
api.exportDataAsPdf({
    pageSize: { width: 720, height: 540 },
    pageOrientation: 'landscape',
});
```

Header rows repeat on new pages by default. Set `repeatHeader=false` to render headers only once.

